hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"331","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Hujrain, qala: haddasana 'Ali bin Mushir, 'an Muslim al-A'war, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) beemar ki iyaadat farmate the, janaazon mein shirkat farmate the, ghare par sawar hote the, aur ghulam ki dawat qubool farmate the. Aur Bani Quraiza ke din woh ek ghare par sawar the jis ki lagaam liff (khajoor ke chhal) ki rassi se bandhi hui thi, aur un par liff ka kajawa tha."
"332","[AI-translation] Haddasana Wasil bin 'Abd al-A'la al-Kufi, qala: haddasana Muhammad bin Fudayl, 'an al-A'mash, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko jow ki roti aur baasi charbi ki dawat di jati, toh aap qubool farmate. Aur haqiqat yeh hai ke ek yahoodi ke paas unki ek zireh (chain mail) tehri thi, toh unhein usko chhudane ka maal nahi mila yahan tak ke aap ki wafaat ho gayi."
"333","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmud bin Ghaylan, qala: haddasana Abu Dawud al-Hafari, 'an Sufyan, 'an al-Rabi' bin Sabih, 'an Yazid bin Aban, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne ek purani zeen par hajj kiya, aur un par ek kambal tha jo char dirham ke bhi barabar nahi tha, toh aap ne farmaya: Allahumma isay aisa hajj bana de jis mein na riya ho aur na suna-i ka dikhawa ho."
"334","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Abdullah bin 'Abd al-Rahman, qala: haddasana 'Affan, qala: haddasana Hammad bin Salama, 'an Humayd, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se badh kar unhein koi shakhs mahboob nahi tha. Unhon ne kaha: aur woh jab unhein dekhte toh khade nahi hote the, kyunke unhein is baat ka ilm tha ke aap ko yeh napasand hai."
"335","[AI-translation] Haddasana Sufyan bin Waki', qala: haddasana Jumay' bin 'Umar bin 'Abd al-Rahman al-'Ijli, qala: hamein Bani Tamim ke ek shakhs ne, jo Abi Halata (Khadija ke shauhar) ki aulad mein se the aur jinki kuniyat Abu 'Abdullah thi, hadith bayan ki, ek shakhs se jo Abi Halata ke bete the, al-Hasan bin 'Ali se, qala: maine apne mamu Hind bin Abi Halata se poocha, jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki shama-il (zaiba o zeenat) ka wasif (bayan karne wala) tha, aur main chahata tha ke woh mujhe unki shama-il mein se kuch bayan karein. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) - Qala: phir maine unse unke bahar aane (nikalne) ke bare mein poocha, ke woh is mein kya karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) apni zubaan nahi nikalte the magar jo cheez unhein muta'alliq ho, aur unhein jama karte the aur biraGate nahi karte. Har qoum ke mu'azzaz shakhs ki tazeem karte aur unhein un par muqarrar karte the. Logon ko khatartar (agah) karte aur unse ehtiyat karte bina kisi ke chehre aur achche akhlaq ko chhupa le. Apne ashaab ki tafteesh karte, logon se unki haalat poochte. Achchi cheez ko accha aur mazboot karte, bure ko bura batate aur kamzor karte. Mamlaat mein mutadil, mukhtalif (taazad rakne wale) nahi. Yeh ghaflat nahi karte ke kahin log ghaflat mein par jayein ya mayel ho jayein. Har haalat ke liye unke paas tayyar saman tha. Haq se na qusur karte aur na had se guzar jate. Jin logon ko aap qareeb rakhte wahi unke mukhtaar (behtar) the, unke nazdik unhein afzal jo ziyada naseh karti, aur unhein unke nazdik azeem martabe wala jo achi muwasat aur madad karta. Qala: phir maine unse unke majlis ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ya toh khade hote ya baithte, magar zikr ke sath. Aur jab kisi qoum ke paas pahunchte toh wahin baith jate jahan majlis khatam hota tha, aur isi ka hukm dete the. Apne har baitne wale ko uska hissa dete, baitne wala shakhs yeh nahi samajhta ke koi un se zyada mu'azzaz hai. Jo shaksh un ke sath baithta ya apni zarurat unke sath bayan karta, aap uski bardasht karte yahan tak ke woh khud uth kar chala jaye. Jo unse koi zarurat mangta, aap use khali haath nahi lotate, ya toh use ada kar dete ya narmi ke saath farmate. Unche (akhlaq aur rahat) ne logon ko ghera tha, toh aap unke baap ban gaye aur unke nazdik haq mein sab barabar the. Unka majlis ilm, hilm, haya, amanat aur sabr ka majlis tha. Us mein aawazein nahi buland ki jatin. Us mein auraton ki burai nahi ki jati. Us mein faltu harkaton ko dosh nahi diya jata, magar (sab) baraabar the. Balki woh us mein taqwa ke zariye fazilat hasil karte the. Mutawazi the, us mein buzurg ki tazeem karte, chote par raham karte, haajat mand ko tarjih dete, ghareeb ki hifazat karte."
"336","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin 'Abdullah bin Bazee', qala: haddasana Bishr bin al-Mufaddal, qala: haddasana Sa'id, 'an Qatada, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar mujhe ek pind bhi tohfe mein diya jaye toh main qubool karunga, aur agar us par dawat di jaye toh main qubool karunga."
"337","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bishshar, qala: haddasana 'Abd al-Rahman, qala: haddasana Sufyan, 'an Muhammad bin al-Munkadir, 'an Jabir, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) mere paas aaye, na kisi khachar par sawar the aur na kisi sust ghode par."
"338","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Abdullah bin 'Abd al-Rahman, qala: haddasana Abu Nu'aym, qala: anba'ana Yahya bin Abi al-Haytham al-'Attar, qala: maine Yusuf bin 'Abdullah bin Salam ko suna, qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne mera naam Yusuf rakha, aur mujhe apni god mein bithaya, aur mere sir par hath phera."
"339","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Mansur, qala: haddasana Abu Dawud al-Tayalisi, qala: haddasana al-Rabi' wa huwa ibn Sabih, qala: haddasana Yazid al-Raqashi, 'an Anas bin Malik, anna Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne ek purani zeen aur kambal par hajj kiya, hum uski qimat char dirham hi samajhte the. Jab unki sawari un par seedhi ho gayi, aap ne farmaya: Labbaik, aisi hajh ke liye jis mein na kisi ko sunane ka dikhawa ho aur na riya ho."
"340","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Abd al-Razzaq, qala: haddasana Ma'mar, 'an Thabit al-Bunani, wa 'Asim al-Ahwal, 'an Anas bin Malik, anna ek darzi shakhs ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki dawat di, toh unke sath tharid (roti ka chura) aur us par dubba (kaddu) pesh kiya. Qala: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) dubba (kaddu) uthate the aur aap kaddu pasand karte the. Thabit ne kaha: maine Anas ko farmate hue suna: ab jo khana mere liye banaya jata hai jis mein kaddu bhi banaya ja sakta hai, toh us mein kaddu zaroor banaya jata hai."
"341","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abdullah bin Saleh, qala: Haddasana Muawiya bin Saleh, 'an Yahya bin Saeed, 'an Amrah, qalat: Aisha se poocha gaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne ghar mein kya karte the? Unhon ne farmaya: Woh bashar mein se ek bashar the, apna kapra jhoont-te the, apni bakri dhoodte the, aur apna kaam khud karte the."
"342","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abbas bin Muhammad Ad-Dauri, qala: Haddasana Abdullah bin Yazid Al-Muqri, qala: Haddasana Laith bin Sa'd, qala: Haddathani Abu Uthman Al-Waleed bin Abi Al-Waleed, 'an Sulaiman bin Kharjah, 'an Kharjah bin Zaid bin Thabit, qala: Zaid bin Thabit ke paas kuch log aaye toh un se kahne lage: Hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ahadees bayaan karein. Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhein kya bayaan karoon? Main un ka hamsaya tha, toh jab un par wahi nazil hoti toh mere paas bhejte aur main likh deta. Toh jab hum duniya ka zikr karte toh woh bhi humare sath karte, aur jab hum aakhirat ka zikr karte toh woh bhi humare sath karte, aur jab hum khaane ka zikr karte toh woh bhi humare sath karte. Toh yeh sab kuch main tumhein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayaan karta hoon."
"343","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa, qala: Haddasana Yunus bin Bukair, 'an Muhammad bin Ishaq, 'an Ziad bin Abi Ziad, 'an Muhammad bin Ka'b Al-Qurazi, 'an Amr bin Al-Aas, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) qaum ke bad-tareen log ki taraf apna chehra aur guftagu mutawajjih rakhte the, is tarah unhein khush karte the. Toh woh mere taraf apna chehra aur guftagu mutawajjih rakhte, yahan tak ke main samajhne laga ke main qaum mein behtar hoon. Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, main behtar hoon ya Abu Bakr? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Abu Bakr. Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, main behtar hoon ya Umar? Aap ne farmaya: Umar. Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, main behtar hoon ya Uthman? Aap ne farmaya: Uthman. Toh jab main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha, toh unhon ne mujhe sach bata di, aur mujhe khwahish hui ke kash main un se na poochta."
"344","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaiba bin Saeed, qala: Haddasana Ja'far bin Sulaiman Ad-Duba'i, 'an Thabit, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki das saal khidmat ki, toh unhon ne kabhi mujhe 'uff' tak nahi kaha, aur na hi kisi aisi cheez ke liye jo main ne ki, yeh farmaya ke tune yeh kyun kiya, aur na hi kisi aisi cheez ke liye jo main ne chhodi, yeh farmaya ke tune yeh kyun chhodi? Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sab logon se behtar akhlaq wale the. Aur main ne na koi khaaz chhua aur na harir, aur na koi aisi cheez jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki hatheli se naram ho, aur main ne kabhi mushk nahi chhui aur na koi itr jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paseene se ziyada khushbu-daar ho."
"345","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaiba bin Saeed, wa Ahmad bin Abdah huwa Ad-Dabbi, wal-ma'na wahid, qala: Haddasana Hammad bin Zaid, 'an Salm Al-Alawi, 'an Anas bin Malik, 'an Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), ke un ke paas ek shakhs tha jis mein zardi ke asar the. Qala: Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kisi ko aisi cheez muqaable karna na pasand karte jo woh na-pasand kare, toh jab woh shakhs uth gaya, toh aap ne qaum se farmaya: Kaash tum us se keh dete ke yeh zardi chhod de."
